# ExItS component priority (LOCKED)

When adding or changing UI, use the locked ExItS component for that job. Do not add a native control or a new component when an ExItS component already exists.

Search `src/Products/PinoyBusinessPOS/ExItS.PinoyBusinessPOS.React/src/components/exits/` and `/ui-standards` first.

| Job | Use |
| --- | --- |
| Text input | `ExitsOrgEhgInput` — `ext org-ehg input-glass qa primary stacked md icon-none shape-standard no-shadow` (`exits-org-ehg-input-glass.mdc`) |
| Search field | Org EHG Search glass bare (`exits-org-ehg-input-glass.mdc`; `icon-bare` + search mark) |
| Button | `ExitsOrgEhgButton` — Org EHG Button glass (`exits-org-ehg-btn-glass.mdc`; not FAB/Speed dial) |
| Single choice | `ExitsOrgEhgSelect` — `ext org-ehg select-glass qa primary stacked md icon-none shape-standard no-shadow` (`exits-org-ehg-select-glass.mdc`) |
| Multiple choice | Org EHG Select glass multi (`exits-org-ehg-select-glass.mdc`) |
| Switch | `Switch` |
| Tabs | `ExitsTabs` |
| Table / responsive rows | `ExitsTable`, `ExitsResponsiveDataView` |
| Quantity | `QuantityStepper` with `variant="outline"` |
| Status | `StatusChip` |
| Confirm | `ConfirmActionDialog` |
| Create or edit | `FormDrawer` |
| Short dialog | `ExitsModal` (footer lock: `exits-modal-default.mdc`) |
| Soft Glass card | Quick Actions recipe (`exits-soft-glass-card.mdc`) |
| Soft Glass primary fields | Glass input, select, and search (`exits-soft-glass-primary-fields.mdc`) |
| Soft Glass date / date-time | Soft Glass Roll recipe (`exits-soft-glass-datetime.mdc`) |
| Org EHG date / date-time | Product: `ExitsDateGlassDateTimeField`; playground: `OrgEhgDateGlassField` (`exits-org-ehg-date-glass.mdc`) |
| Org EHG select | `ExitsOrgEhgSelect` locked select-glass (`exits-org-ehg-select-glass.mdc`) |
| Org EHG input / search | `ExitsOrgEhgInput` locked input-glass (`exits-org-ehg-input-glass.mdc`) |
| Org EHG button | `ExitsOrgEhgButton` locked btn-glass (`exits-org-ehg-btn-glass.mdc`) |
| Quick Action | `SoftGlassQuickAction` Org EHG default (`exits-org-ehg-qa-glass.mdc`; Stores to pay lock) |
| Tooltip | `ExitsTooltip` (lock: `exits-tooltip-default.mdc`) |

A table filter is Org EHG Select glass multi (or Soft Glass `ExitsMultiSelect` only when the user names Soft Glass). Empty selection means all rows.
New Personal / Utang cards use Soft Glass (light + dark) — not flat Material cards.

New inputs/searches use `ExitsOrgEhgInput` / Org EHG Search glass (`exits-input-default.mdc` / `exits-org-ehg-input-glass.mdc`). New buttons use `ExitsOrgEhgButton` (`exits-org-ehg-btn-glass.mdc`). New selects use `ExitsOrgEhgSelect` (`exits-select-default.mdc`). Soft Glass primary field groups stay under `exits-soft-glass-primary-fields.mdc`.
Icon-only actions use Soft Glass `ExitsTooltip` (`exits-tooltip-default.mdc`), not native `title` alone.

Detail: `.cursor/rules/exits-ui-architecture.mdc`.
